sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Admin as Admin
    participant IssuerPortal as Issuer Portal
    participant SDK as EIP-712 SDK
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant Contract as IssuerRegistry + CredentialRegistry
    participant IPFS as IPFS (optional)

    Note over Admin,Contract: Bước 1: Đăng ký Trust Anchor (một lần)
    Admin->>Contract: addSigner(issuerAddress, did)
    Contract-->>Admin: SignerAdded event

    Note over IssuerPortal,IPFS: Bước 2: Phát hành batch 10.000 credentials (OFF-CHAIN)
    IssuerPortal->>IssuerPortal: Upload CSV (10.000 dòng)
    IssuerPortal->>SDK: buildCredentials(csv, template)
    loop 10.000 lần — HOÀN TOÀN OFF-CHAIN
        SDK->>SDK: Sinh disclosures (salt, key, value)
        SDK->>SDK: Tính privateClaims commitments
        SDK->>SDK: Hash publicClaims → publicClaimsHash
        SDK->>SDK: signTypedData(domain, types, credential)
    end
    SDK->>SDK: buildMerkleTree(10.000 leaves) → root + proofs
    SDK-->>IssuerPortal: { credentials[], merkleRoot, proofs }

    Note over IssuerPortal,IPFS: Bước 3: Anchor (ON-CHAIN — 1 transaction duy nhất)
    IssuerPortal->>IPFS: pin(batchMetadata.json) [optional]
    IPFS-->>IssuerPortal: ipfsCid
    IssuerPortal->>Contract: anchorBatch(merkleRoot, batchIndex, 10000, ipfsCid)
    Contract->>Contract: anchors[merkleRoot] = { now, issuer, 10000, cid }
    Contract-->>IssuerPortal: BatchAnchored event + txHash
    IssuerPortal->>DB: Lưu Batch + 10.000 Credentials + proofs

    Note over IssuerPortal,IPFS: Tổng chi phí on-chain: 1 tx ≈ 25M gas ≈ $0.23/cred (mainnet)
    Note over IssuerPortal,IPFS: Zero gas per credential ✓
